    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734875000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Alex. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734880000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, I need to start a return for my VeloBand GPS Tracker.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36405,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734885933333
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I can certainly look into that for you. Can I get your order number or the email address associated with your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734889933333
    },
    {
      "text": "It's sam.jones@email.com. Just tell me if I can return it or not, I don't have a lot of time.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36405,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734898399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course. Pulling that up now... I see the order for the VeloBand, delivered twelve days ago. Before we proceed, could you tell me what specifically is the issue? Is it a technical fault or...?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734904799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Look, it's not broken. The interface is just confusing. It's hard to use and I honestly expected more for what I paid. Even the user manual wasn't much help.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36405,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734917933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. One moment while I review our return policy for your item.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734928599998
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36405,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734933599998
    },
    {
      "text": "Alright, thank you for your patience. I've checked our system, and it looks like all our items are eligible for return within 90 days of delivery.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734934299998
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yes or no?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36405,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734944233331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes. Since you received it only twelve days ago, you're well within that 90-day window. I've gone ahead and approved the return. I'm sending the pre-paid shipping label to the email on file now.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734945366664
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. That's all I needed. Thank you.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 36405,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734958499997
    },
    {
      "text": "You're welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 302,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767734961233330
